{"version":1,"content":"<p>元朗警區特別職務隊聯同入境處人員昨日（22日）於區內展開打擊非法賣淫活動。</p><p>行動中共拘捕24名內地女子，年齡介乎27至57歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」，所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:24:29.135564+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:41:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:17.088662+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:07.096344+00:00","content_hash":"16f727af9ba8aebc0a450a7bc12686bf376589c61160cc9a9c5e21a043b5387b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}